# RPU game code

- Edit game rules in `RoadKings.ino`; hardware IDs in `RoadKings.h`.
- Avoid editing `RPU.cpp` unless fixing shared OS behavior.
- Road Kings is `RPU_MPU_ARCHITECTURE` 15 — no Bally/Stern `ARCHITECTURE<10` switch-trigger solenoid arrays.
- Do not hardcode install-specific values; use `RPU_Config.h` and document in CONFIGURATION.md.
- Road Kings has no sling switches; do not expect `SW_LEFT_SLING` / `SW_RIGHT_SLING` closures.
